SUMMARY:South Orange Downtown
DESCRIPTION:The South Orange Farmers Market takes place every Wednesday from June 3 through October 28 from 1PM to 6PM at 12 Sloan Street in the Sloan Street Parking Lot\, rain or shine. Shop fresh seasonal produce\, baked goods\, cold-pressed juices\, locally made cheeses\, fresh breads\, house made pickles\, and specialty food items from a mix of returning favorites and new vendors. The market also features grab and go lunch and dinner options\, making it the perfect midweek stop for shopping\, dining\, and exploring downtown South Orange. For more information\, please visit: https://www.southorangedowntown.org/farmers-market \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
