SUMMARY:F.A.M. Fest at Montclair Brewery
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Independence Day with a day-long party featuring live music by a six-piece band and Gary Michael Houston\, multiple sets by DJ Beloved\, a variety of local\, black-owned businesses\, food available for purchase by Pimento Smoke BBQ\, Q&A\, and all the craft beer\, non-alcoholic drinks\, and hard seltzer cocktails you could ask for!\nPlease note: both ticket prices will increase on the day of the event. Don’t wait and get your tickets today!\nOutside drinks of any kind\, including water and reusable water bottles\, are not permitted.\nNo outside chairs\, tables\, coolers\, etc. will be permitted. \nShare this:\n				Share on Facebook (Opens in new window)\n				Facebook\n			\n				Share on Bluesky (Opens in new window)\n				Bluesky\n			\n				Share on LinkedIn (Opens in new window)\n				LinkedIn\n			\n				Share on Threads (Opens in new window)\n				Threads\n			\n				Share on Nextdoor (Opens in new window)\n				Nextdoor\n			\n				Share on WhatsApp (Opens in new window)\n				WhatsApp\n			\n				Email a link to a friend (Opens in new window)\n				Email
